; Objects waiting to be spawned
;
; Count of the 4-byte records (template address, y, x) queued in the object list that starts at $5DC0 (pointer
; #R$BE56) and have not yet been turned into live objects. #R$8870 sets it from the actor lists of the cutscenes and
; the enemies and entities that shoot or split add one with the record they append (#R$B620, #R$BB57, ...); the frame
; update #R$A596 calls #R$8905 while it is nonzero, and that routine spawns the records into free object slots at
; $C100 and decrements it (it is cleared at once when no slot is free).
@label=SpawnQueueCount
g$8552 DEFB $00
